WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:06.880
The power dynamics of the One piece world have&nbsp;
just completely been flipped on its head. With the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:14.640
official release of chapter 1053, we finally know&nbsp;
how the government has assessed the events that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:20.560
happened during the raid on Onigashima on Wano.&nbsp;
Big news Morgan and the Gorosei have sat down,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:27.840
cranked the numbers and updated a whole number of&nbsp;
bounties for everyone involved in the battle. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:32.640
three captains, Luffy, Law and Kid, all have&nbsp;
received a massive increase to their wanted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:39.040
posters, each of them now sitting at a staggering&nbsp;
3 billion berries. At first glance, that might&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:44.720
seem a bit low, given that both Big Mom and Kaido&nbsp;
had bounties well over 4 billion, but remember&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:53.040
that Blackbeards bounty is only 2.2 billion. So&nbsp;
all three of them just overtook the possibly most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:59.120
dangerous pirate on the planet. Also, it of course&nbsp;
follows the really nice pattern of 3, that Luffy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:05.600
has followed throughout the story. 30M, 300M and&nbsp;
now 3 B berries. Even if you expected a bit more,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:11.280
I just want to appreciate that Luffy and&nbsp;
co now have the 4th highest known bounty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:17.840
in the entire story, given that Kaido and Big&nbsp;
Mom presumably don't have a bounty anymore,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:23.760
because they fell into a volcano and apparently&nbsp;
that's just that. So now we have 3 members of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:29.840
the worst generation, that was looked upon as&nbsp;
just a group of rookies only 2 years earlier,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:33.600
throning at the peak of the pirate world.

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:40.640
And yet somehow even more shockingly, the goose&nbsp;
have also identified the two official replacements&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:47.760
for both Kaido and Big Mom for the title of the&nbsp;
four most powerful pirates in all of One PIece,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:54.400
the Yonko. The last remaining member of the&nbsp;
original 4 is shanks, who with his 4billion berry&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.400 --> 00:02:00.240
bounty is now officially the most wanted pirate in&nbsp;
the world, probably only topped by the head of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:06.400
revolutionary army, Monkey D. Dragon. It's not&nbsp;
like we need any more intrigue for Shanks. He's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:12.560
already the one character in the story&nbsp;
every single fan, including me is just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:17.680
dying to learn more about. But it&nbsp;
definitely helps to push the mystery.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:25.440
And funnily enough all 4 current YOnko have a&nbsp;
personal connection to shanks for some reason.

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:30.000
The next in line is Blackbeard, who has&nbsp;
been an emperor since the marineford war&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:35.280
and who tirelessly keeps increasing&nbsp;
his power and influence in the world.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:41.440
Blackbeard without any doubt has been built&nbsp;
up as one of the major final antagonists,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:47.280
if not THE final antagonist that Luffy will&nbsp;
have to face to actually reach his goal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:52.480
and become pirate king. We have seen&nbsp;
surprisingly little of his actual abilities,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:57.680
but just the little we know about him and his&nbsp;
crew is already enough to let us know what an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.680 --> 00:03:03.920
incredibly powerful enemy he will be for Luffy&nbsp;
and the other straw hats. Blackbeard rose into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:10.240
the ranks of the Yonko after taking out Whitebeard&nbsp;
at marineford and literally taking his place.

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:18.320
Which is absolutely ironic and hilarious,&nbsp;
because that was literally Buggy's idea when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:25.920
he was escaping impel down together with&nbsp;
luffy and the other level 6 prisoners. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:30.240
literally dreams of becoming an&nbsp;
emperor and then pirate king.

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:37.280
What seemed like gag moment for his&nbsp;
character has now for whatever reason&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:42.400
actually turned out to be true. I'm still&nbsp;
trying to get over this. And honestly it will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:49.840
probably take a while to get used to. Buggy the&nbsp;
clown, emperor of the seas. Holy moly. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:56.160
in retrospect, when we look at the great scheme&nbsp;
of things, it does truly feel like Eiichiro Oda,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.160 --> 00:04:02.400
the author of one piece was working towards&nbsp;
this for a while now. Ever since impel down,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:09.600
Buggy has been constantly getting more and more&nbsp;
influence and recognition by pure accident really,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:15.920
recruiting some of the most powerful and notorious&nbsp;
pirates to his cause and even rising into the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:22.400
ranks of the warlords. Of course you could joke&nbsp;
that Buggy might have been doing this all on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:29.200
purpose all along and it wasn'T luck at all. And&nbsp;
honestly, At this point this is a real possibility&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:35.520
given the circumstances. We don't really know&nbsp;
how he got the position or high his bounty is,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:42.160
but there are a ton of interesting possibilities&nbsp;
I have floating around my head. I will definitely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:47.840
dedicate and entire video to Emperor buggy in the&nbsp;
next one or two weeks. So make sure to subscribe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:53.040
if you want to see that. You'll also help me to&nbsp;
increase my bounty by 100Berry by subscribing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:58.720
which is super important, because we might not&nbsp;
know Buggy's bounty yet, but we know that of this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:07.840
slime ball here, Trebol, with 99M berries. And I'M&nbsp;
only at 60m. So let's go and at least beat Trebol.

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:15.360
The 4th emperor on the other hand, has a bounty&nbsp;
SO high now, that I will never be able to catch up&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:22.000
in my wildest dreams. Luffy had unofficially been&nbsp;
named 5th emperor of the see by Big News Morgan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:28.560
after escaping Whole Cake Island and defeating&nbsp;
Katakuri. Now, after not only having beaten Kaido,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:34.800
the worlds strongest creature, but also having&nbsp;
awakened a mythical Zoan Devil Fruit that the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:41.200
World Government has been fearing for 800&nbsp;
years, it's no big surprise, that he has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:47.600
officially been named Yonko and thus has reached&nbsp;
the last step before becoming pirate king.

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:53.360
On top of all this, we have just witnessed&nbsp;
Greenbull's terrifying abilities, who is said&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:59.040
to be on the same level as Fujitora. The marines&nbsp;
clearly have made up for the loss of Aokiji and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:06.560
Sengoku. And of course we still haven't seen the&nbsp;
results of the SSG, the special science group led&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:14.080
by doctor vegapunk, that seems to be more than&nbsp;
capable of replacing the former warlord system.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:18.320
It must be truly terrifying indeed.

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:27.920
So the span of just a few weeks, the entire&nbsp;
world order has fundamentally changed. It used&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:33.600
to be a relatively stable balance between the 4&nbsp;
emperors, all careful to mess with each other,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:38.880
the 7 warlords, who were strong pirates&nbsp;
aligned with the government, as well as the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:45.920
marines. Over the course of Wano, the warlord&nbsp;
system has been abolished, Two of the YOnko&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:53.360
have fallen and replaced and the revolutionary&nbsp;
army has successfully infiltrated the holy land&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:58.800
of Marijois during the reverie. We have learned&nbsp;
about the true secret ruler of the world, Imu,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:04.000
who controls the entire world government, have&nbsp;
seen Shanks talk with the Gorosei and have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:12.560
witnessed Luffy's immensely powerful awakening and&nbsp;
the return of Joy Boy and the drums of liberation.

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:27.920
I think it's pretty fair to say, that the one&nbsp;
piece world now and the one piece world at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:35.040
beginning of the story are very different indeed.&nbsp;
Gone is the stability of Whiteboards Era. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:40.400
Government is building military force like never&nbsp;
before, the revolutionaries have begun to openly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:46.480
attack the celestial dragons, Black beard has&nbsp;
broken all rules of devil fruit use and power&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:53.360
balance and Luffy, who used to be a upcoming small&nbsp;
fry in a giant world filled with powerful people,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:58.960
is now one of the handful of selected people&nbsp;
in the world, powerful enough to shape the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.960 --> 00:09:04.480
future of the entire planet and all of it's&nbsp;
inhabitants. No wonder really One Piece is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:09.280
about to move into its final saga, if I look at&nbsp;
it from this perspective. Oh, and then there is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:14.400
of course also Buggy, the biggest wild card of&nbsp;
them all, that now it seems will be playing a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:20.320
much more central role during the ending of&nbsp;
One Piece, than we all originally expected.

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:24.720
I think while it's really easy to focus&nbsp;
on Luffy's growth, and don't get me wrong,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:31.360
saying it was rapid would be the understatement&nbsp;
of the century, we should not forget, that all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:37.760
other players in the endgame here have been&nbsp;
getting stronger and more influential as well.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:42.880
Blackbeard just keeps collecting more and&nbsp;
more powerful devil fruits and crew members.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:48.400
Shanks is doing his super special secret&nbsp;
mission impossible plan behind the scenes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:56.080
and the government and the marines seem even more&nbsp;
well equipped and all powerful than ever before.

00:09:56.080 --> 00:10:03.280
Chapter 1053 also hinted at the reveal of&nbsp;
Pluton, that apparently is located in Wano.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:08.080
Something Robbin has known all along but&nbsp;
somehow decided not to share with anyone.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:13.200
Thanks for nothing Robin. Wether Pluton&nbsp;
will turn out to be an actual weapon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:20.080
or simply Momonosuke, the heir of the Kozuki&nbsp;
clan, similar to how Shirahoshi is Poseidon,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:25.600
once the ancient weapons unleash their true&nbsp;
powers, they will just add to the already&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:32.080
over boiling pot of fast approaching conflict,&nbsp;
brewing all over the new world right now.

00:10:32.080 --> 00:10:35.920
In a really ironic way, the new&nbsp;
world order in One Piece doesn't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:35.920 --> 00:10:42.080
really deserve that name. Because all&nbsp;
individuals involved, Blackbeard, Buggy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:49.680
Luffy, Kid, Law, even someone like Greenbull, they&nbsp;
are all people who seem to bring about the exact&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:57.600
opposite of order. This new system is a world of&nbsp;
chaos, that is ready to be fundamentally changed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:57.600 --> 00:11:03.840
so that pirates and marines and Yonkos will not&nbsp;
even be a thing anymore. We're in the face now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:08.400
where Luffy will have the ability to change the&nbsp;
world, bring the dawn and create a world where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:14.240
everyone is free to be who they are and do what&nbsp;
they want to do and live a happy and safe life.

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:19.760
After all we now know that this is Luffy's&nbsp;
actually dream. Becoming pirate king so he can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:25.920
create this free world for his friends. We do NOT&nbsp;
know however what everyone else wants. Imu and the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:25.920 --> 00:11:33.440
Gorosei want to stay in power and Buggy presumably&nbsp;
still just wants to find a massive pile of gold,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:39.520
but we don't know what Blackbeards ultimate goal&nbsp;
is, or shanks or Kid or even many of the admirals.

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:48.400
All of this really seems to be&nbsp;
massive set up for some of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:53.200
best fights and meeting we&nbsp;
have seen in one piece so far.

00:11:53.200 --> 00:12:00.080
The one I personally look forward to the most is&nbsp;
actually that between Luffy and Blackbeard for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:04.400
obvious reasons. But there are a number of&nbsp;
other meetings that are basically guaranteed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:04.400 --> 00:12:09.440
to happen as well. Oda has come up&nbsp;
with an ingenious idea to foreshadow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:09.440 --> 00:12:14.640
big battles and unresolved conflicts in&nbsp;
the story in the most unusual way ever,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:20.560
by giving characters their iconic scars. So if&nbsp;
you want to find out what Luffy and co's scars&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:20.560 --> 00:12:25.360
predict for the future of one piece, you&nbsp;
should really watch this video right here.

